  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38137588",
      "title": "Using Store Data In Effects",
      "lectureOrder": 702,
      "videoOrder": 647,
      "sourceHash": "6d55004f83a534123fd68a8f51b84255ab9bdac35f296b41b5e3e01b621d9f97",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "So now that we got our first effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "let's improve it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.7,
          "end": 8.13,
          "en": "by making sure that we don't store the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.13,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "by which the counter changed in local storage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "but instead the latest counter value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.65,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "that's stored in our NgRx store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "And that's of course a pretty common requirement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 20.73,
          "en": "that you want to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.73,
          "end": 23.52,
          "en": "to data stored in the store instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.52,
          "end": 26.643,
          "en": "of just the value that's attached to an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.69,
          "end": 29.49,
          "en": "And you can easily get hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.49,
          "end": 33.93,
          "en": "of the latest value stored in the store by using the special",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.93,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "with latest from operator offered by rxjs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.84,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "So this must be imported from rxjs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 46.23,
          "en": "and with latest from then allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 51.09,
          "en": "to pass some value to this operator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.09,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "which is then available in the next operator thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "For that here in this effects clause,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "we can inject our store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 65.81,
          "en": "so our NgRx store by importing store from NgRx store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.47,
          "end": 68.55,
          "en": "and by using that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "as a type assignment here for this store property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 75.42,
          "en": "And then here in with latest from,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.42,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "we can use this store select",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 82.533,
          "en": "and select our counter, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 87.3,
          "en": "And here we then might want to add some type annotations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.3,
          "end": 90.09,
          "en": "to get better TypeScript support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.09,
          "end": 93.6,
          "en": "by defining the shape of our global store here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.6,
          "end": 95.19,
          "en": "where we have this counter key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 99.9,
          "en": "that stores the counter store as a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.9,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "And of course we could also use our selectors here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 105.9,
          "en": "our select count selector, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.9,
          "end": 109.113,
          "en": "which is imported from counter selectors from that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.663,
          "end": 113.07,
          "en": "With this operator added here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.07,
          "end": 115.59,
          "en": "in the next operator thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.59,
          "end": 118.83,
          "en": "we get a different kind of value as an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.83,
          "end": 121.56,
          "en": "Instead of just getting the action here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.56,
          "end": 123.51,
          "en": "we're now actually getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.51,
          "end": 126.54,
          "en": "an array of different pieces of data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.54,
          "end": 129.93,
          "en": "To be precise, an array with two elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.93,
          "end": 132.96,
          "en": "And therefore we can also use array destructuring here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.96,
          "end": 137.22,
          "en": "to pull these two elements out of the array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "The first element will be our action just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 144.27,
          "en": "but the second element will be that data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.27,
          "end": 147.423,
          "en": "which we kind of merged into this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "So here our counter, in this case a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 154.71,
          "en": "as you can also see here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.71,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "And therefore, of course, now here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 158.16,
          "en": "we can still log our action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.16,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "but we can now also store our counter in local storage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 165.423,
          "en": "We just need to convert it to a string though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.86,
          "end": 169.2,
          "en": "And that's how easy it is to get hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.2,
          "end": 172.53,
          "en": "of a value stored in our NgRx store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.53,
          "end": 174.87,
          "en": "and how we can then use this value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.87,
          "end": 177.09300000000002,
          "en": "in our effect pipeline here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 179.73,
          "en": "And with this change in place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.73,
          "end": 182.76,
          "en": "if we save everything and serve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.76,
          "end": 185.97,
          "en": "you will see that if I now go to application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.97,
          "end": 189.45,
          "en": "and I clear this count value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "now you see that as I change the counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.3,
          "end": 196.11,
          "en": "this value is also reflected here on the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 198.27,
          "en": "So now we're not just storing the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.27,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "by which the counter gets changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 202.713,
          "en": "but instead the latest counter value.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
